StateViewHistoryTest
├── when K is zero
│   ├── it should return intro_len 0
│   └── it should return step None
├── when K is n or greater
│   ├── it should return intro_len 0
│   └── it should return step None
├── when K is a valid prefix and j is not less than K
│   ├── it should return intro_len K
│   └── it should return step None
└── when K is a valid prefix and j is less than K
    ├── it should return intro_len K
    └── it should return step Some cell at t_init plus j times dt
